  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, $q_1=1 \\times 10^{-7} \\mathrm{C}, q_2$ and $2 \\times 10^{-7} \\mathrm{C}$, $r=20 \\mathrm{~cm}=20 \\times 10^{-2} \\mathrm{~m}$<br />$F=\\frac{q_1 q_2}{4 \\pi \\varepsilon_0 r^2}=\\frac{9 \\times 10^9 \\times 1 \\times 10^{-7} \\times 2 \\times 10^{-7}}{\\left(20 \\times 10^{-2}\\right)^2}$<br />$=4.5 \\times 10^{-3} N$",
    "image": null
  },
